  "family_quality_rules": [
    "Dragon scale is communicated by large environmental landmarks, not tiny scenery.",
    "Hoard treasure is drawn as broad masses and containers, never coin-by-coin texture.",
    "Lair identity should show repeated creature use through one clear nest, perch, hoard, relic, or resting feature.",
    "Architecture and geology support the dragon silhouette instead of competing with it."
